WEBVTT

00:01:40.273 --> 00:01:41.421
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> Good evening, Madam.

00:01:41.628 --> 00:01:42.955
Are you Hannah Davis?

00:01:44.791 --> 00:01:45.382
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:46.218 --> 00:01:46.841
Yes, I am.

00:01:47.143 --> 00:01:48.283
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> I’d like to speak to you.

00:01:48.621 --> 00:01:49.325
Can I come in?

00:02:09.116 --> 00:02:10.861
Are you a friend of Jamie Dixon?

00:02:14.389 --> 00:02:14.979
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Er, yes.

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:20.460
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> Well, I’m afraid I have some bad news for you.

00:02:23.741 --> 00:02:28.196
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> What? What’s happened?

00:02:29.793 --> 00:02:31.562
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> Jamie had an accident this evening.

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:33.714
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Oh no.

00:02:36.307 --> 00:02:37.470
What kind of accident?

00:02:38.765 --> 00:02:41.364
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> He was crossing the road and a car hit him.

00:02:47.891 --> 00:02:55.532
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> When…when did this happen? And where?

00:02:56.093 --> 00:02:58.719
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> This evening at twenty-five past five.

00:02:59.613 --> 00:03:01.451
He was crossing the road, near the theatre.

00:03:04.346 --> 00:03:08.897
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Oh no! How is he?

00:03:09.648 --> 00:03:10.515
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> He’s in hospital.

00:03:11.889 --> 00:03:15.091
He’s got a bad injury to his head and two broken legs.

00:03:20.076 --> 00:03:21.770
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> But is he going to be OK?

00:03:22.336 --> 00:03:23.105
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> We don’t know.

00:03:23.344 --> 00:03:24.480
He’s in intensive care.

00:03:26.852 --> 00:03:27.980
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Oh no.

00:03:33.159 --> 00:03:34.227
And the driver of the car?

00:03:35.115 --> 00:03:36.038
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> She didn’t stop.

00:03:37.661 --> 00:03:38.170
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> She?

00:03:39.351 --> 00:03:42.724
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> Yes, it was a woman in a black car.

00:03:44.427 --> 00:03:46.634
Somebody saw the number of the car.

00:03:51.216 --> 00:03:52.995
You have a black car outside, don’t you, Madam?

00:03:57.320 --> 00:04:00.673
Is your number plate G-Y five six, R-Z-R?

00:04:03.642 --> 00:04:06.479
<v><b>Hannah:</b></v> Yes…yes, it is.

00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:12.715
<v><b>Policewoman:</b></v> Can you tell me where you were at twenty-five past five this evening?